  "description": "The PUBLIC C7 is our modern interpretation of the iconic Dutch city bike—an enduring design trusted by riders across Europe.\nEquipped with smooth, reliable shifting and a versatile gear range, the C7 is ready to tackle hills from San Francisco to Seattle. Its step-through frame makes mounting and dismounting effortless, creating a graceful and practical design for everyday riding.\nPuncture-resistant tires, a full chainguard, and fenders help keep you clean and dry in all conditions, while strong dual-pivot brakes with quick release provide dependable stopping power. Swept-back handlebars promote a relaxed, upright riding position—perfect for comfortable, confident cruising.\nFront and rear rack mounts make it easy to carry what you need, whether you choose baskets, cargo racks, or panniers. You can further personalize your PUBLIC with custom grips, a Brooks saddle, or other accessories to match your style and needs.\nThe C7 delivers exceptional quality at a price point that’s hard to beat.\nWe also make buying online simple with our exclusive Ready to Ride shipping option—delivering a fully assembled, professionally tuned bike right to your doorstep, built and packed with care in the Bay Area.",
